  "creatureDesc_ave_eletrica": "The fastest and the frailest. Wins on volume of pecks, not on power.",
  "creatureDesc_ave_neutro": "Hits light and often. Flies over rock and over pits alike.",
  "creatureDesc_bomba_fogo": "Fights for ground: scatters bombs and vanishes before the blast.",
  "creatureDesc_cao_neutro": "Loyal and blunt: the bite aims itself, the bark clears the way.",
  "creatureDesc_caranguejo_fogo": "Hides in its shell and puffs smoke. Beats whoever loses patience.",
  "creatureDesc_cobra_agua": "Slow on foot, explosive on the strike. Prefers close quarters.",
  "creatureDesc_cogumelo_planta": "Steers the spore by walking. Guide it well and you hit without aiming.",
  "creatureDesc_gato_neutro": "The slowest on foot, but the leap solves it. Fights up close.",
  "creatureDesc_grilo_eletrico": "Fast and dangerous: dives in, shocks, and leaves before the answer.",
  "creatureDesc_leao_eletrico": "Spear reach: skewers a whole line from afar, then charges the gap.",
  "creatureDesc_ourico_eletrico": "Touching it hurts. Lets the enemy come, then charges for it.",
  "creatureDesc_peixe_neutro": "A fish out of water that could not care less: nothing sticks to it.",
  "creatureDesc_pinguim_agua": "Freezes the enemy in place and picks when to strike.",
  "creatureDesc_roda_fogo": "No attack at all: the body is the weapon. At top speed, it runs you over.",
  "creatureDesc_roedor_fogo": "Fast and reckless: strikes from afar and flees leaving fire behind.",
  "creatureDesc_sapo_agua": "Weak attack, clever defense: shields in a bubble and shoots from afar.",
  "creatureDesc_slime_planta": "Kills by waiting, not by hitting. Poisons and lets it work.",
  "creatureDesc_tartaruga_planta": "Slow and stubborn. Shuts the shell, takes the hit, gives it back.",
  "creatureDesc_toco_planta": "Takes root and becomes a wall. The less it moves, the more it takes.",
  "creatureDesc_tornado_fogo": "Fights up close and spins away. Hits hard, but has to get there.",
  "creatureDesc_tubarao_agua": "The hardest hitter. Sinks into the ground and surfaces on top of you.",
  "creatureDesc_urso_planta": "Brute force. Shoves everything away and walks into what is left.",
